# Google Calendar import (optional — the Settings section hides without it).
# Web-application OAuth client from your Google Cloud project, with the app
# origin registered as an authorised redirect URI.
# The matching GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID / GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET go to Supabase edge
# function secrets, NEVER here (this file ships to the browser).
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
